ll description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/stulcrad/CNEC2_0_nested.", "downloads": 12, "tags": ["language:cs", "size_categories:1K<n<10K", "format:parquet", "modality:text", "library:datasets", "library:pandas", "library:mlcroissant", "library:polars", "region:us"], "createdAt": "2024-03-20T11:40:08.000Z", "key": ""}, {"_id": "65fb0098d0bf47b819568489", "id": "stulcrad/CNEC2_0_Supertypes_flat", "author": "stulcrad", "disabled": false, "gated": false, "lastModified": "2025-06-05T14:07:21.000Z", "likes": 0, "trendingScore": 0, "private": false, "sha": "bfd3b7f9fdfd6767fe4f7339d0442c2ce8411656", "description": "LABELS\n00: 'O' = Outside of a named entity\n01: 'B-A' = Beginning of a complex address number (Postal code, street number, even phone number)\n02: 'I-A' = Inside of a number in address\n03: 'B-G' = Beginning of a geographical name\n04: 'I-G' = Inside of a geographical name\n05: 'B-I' = Beginning of an institution name\n06: 'I-I' = Inside of an institution name\n07: 'B-M' = Beginning of a media name (email, server, website, tv series, etc.)\n08: 'I-M' = Inside of a media name\n09: 'B-N' = Beginning of a\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/stulcrad/CNEC2_0_Supertypes_flat.", "downloads": 15, "tags": ["task_categories:token-classification", "language:cs", "size_categories:1K<n<10K", "format:parquet", "modality:text", "library:datasets", "library:pandas", "library:mlcroissant", "library:polars", "region:us"], "createdAt": "2024-03-20T15:28:24.000Z", "key": ""}, {"_id": "65fb086682254f113f3a64a3", "id": "stulcrad/CNEC1_1_Supertypes_flat", "author": "stulcrad", "disabled": false, "gated": false, "lastModified": "2024-05-16T18:28:32.000Z", "likes": 0, "trendingScore": 0, "private": false, "sha": "272ca3690c1ccd51a6d0b41c0bf11f66e93550c1", "downloads": 7, "tags": ["language:cs", "size_categories:1K<n<10K", "format:parquet", "modality:text", "library:datasets", "library:pandas", "library:mlcroissan